{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>A lion's whelp, Judah.</b> The young of all the beasts are called גרים, but you are called גור, which is the cub of a lion, superior to all of them. And he hinted to him that David is destined to come forth from him, for the initial letters of גור אריה יהודה amount in gematria to דוד." "<b>From the prey, my son, you have gone up.</b> Through prey you went up in the days of David, who came from Judah — through, etc., that the Holy One, blessed be He, did for him with the lion and the bear that prey upon the animals, as it is said: ״גם את הארי גם את הדוב הכה עבדך״ — he took heart and relied upon this to do battle with Goliath the Philistine, and defeated him, and was exalted on account of this."], :book :genesis, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 49, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:07:23.039479571Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}